              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Microsoft Corporation, the limited monopoly granted by U.S. patent laws protects against making, using or selling a patented invention within the United States, and \u00a7271(f) makes it infringement to make components in the United States and ship them abroad for reassembly."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Waxman (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c58ebfde40f8738c91b181ec051c000295c7e16843233b1b62db797c490409af",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c58ebfde40f8-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 46,
                "start": 46
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Waxman (Petitioner), according to Waxman (Petitioner), it makes liable as an infringer anyone who supplies from the United States a component with the express intent that the component be combined to create a device that would practice a U.S. patent."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Waxman (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c58ebfde40f8738c91b181ec051c000295c7e16843233b1b62db797c490409af",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c58ebfde40f8-0002-0006"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 46,
                "start": 46
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Waxman (Petitioner), according to Waxman (Petitioner), the software at issue is modular, can be bought, sold, removed, or updated independently of hardware, and is dynamic unlike designs or molds."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. JoSEFFER",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c58ebfde40f8738c91b181ec051c000295c7e16843233b1b62db797c490409af",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c58ebfde40f8-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. JoSEFFER, the component is the actual machine\u2011readable copy of software that is inserted in a device."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. JoSEFFER",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "c58ebfde40f8738c91b181ec051c000295c7e16843233b1b62db797c490409af",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c58ebfde40f8-0001-0005"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 21,
                "start": 21
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. JoSEFFER, a blank disk is not a component of the invention because it is not needed to practice the invention."
        }
